# Check out LF on every platform. Windows would otherwise check out CRLF —
# core.autocrlf defaults to true on the GitHub Windows runner — and prettier,
# whose endOfLine default is lf, then reports every file in the repository as
# unformatted. That fails `pnpm verify` in the package workflow while the same
# commit passes on macOS, which makes the cause easy to misread as a real
# formatting regression.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The one tracked binary. Git detects this on its own; stated so that a future
# addition next to it is an obvious place to add another line.
*.png binary
